title: "Morph Map: see what an AI change did to your codebase"
abstract: "Morph Map scans a codebase into an editable map that you approve. After each change it scans again, animates the difference, explains it in plain words using visible rules, and gives a verdict. It also plans changes, scores complexity, audits public websites and writes a brief for an AI coder."
